{"v":2,"catch":"在七項運動賽事中角逐冠軍！","desc":"《FIELD DAY》是TAITO於1984年發行的動作遊戲。\n玩家將參加七場非傳統運動賽事，從三人賽跑到拔河，力爭成為運動會冠軍。\n每項賽事都有一個合格分數，必須達到該分數才能晉級。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2025-07-31","genres":["運動","動作"],"players":"單機 1–4 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":4,"poff":4,"size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5a80d2e05c3eaa7c9a0cca8ea565bf96cb155ddb8a04831a5f38f8936136166d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2d69a1a692b6b0d3f3d5666fcb5f35d99a513dcc8e2fbfd7633cca47f150a82a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3baded17ff53bd100e1542b5d7f672d62e219a74a5d11eb72d7fe0de6bdc041b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f6d315108c2c266ff4474924a242b168320f594e102e26b130a03859a3941387.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/855c85b1f6d4604802fed39d81ed9eaafe8a7837c320c66222ce3e735a008009.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f3b247e269cacb4bea9f9b4317fda17395c3cbeff555f4c0924747d7750c248d.jpg"],"titleId":"0100da0022af6000"}